===Etymology===
*From {{inh|de|gmh|āmeiʒe}}, from {{inh|de|goh|āmeiʒa}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*āmaitijā}}. Cognate with {{cog|en|ant}}, {{cog|sco|emmot|t=ant}}, dialectal {{cog|nl|emt}}, {{m|nl|empt||ant}}.
*{{sense|electric pallet jack}} From the trademark "Ameise", a brand of the Jungheinrich German company for electric pallet jacks.

